{"createdAt":1785081774815,"expiresAt":1785168174815,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=2962280&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"2962280":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Space Bross","steam_appid":2962280,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[3933720],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=778 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Space Bross</strong></i> is a thrilling blend of action <i><strong>2.5D roguelite,</strong> and <strong>Tower Defense</strong> </i>genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.mp4?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a retired astronaut. You had one job: chill. But then they came for your chicken. Now it’s personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a chaotic journey across deep space in Space Bross, a roguelite tower defense action game where survival means lasers, loot, and a whole lot of clucking vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ebc56995953a56fcea13a2b4cefb8de8.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ebc56995953a56fcea13a2b4cefb8de8.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ebc56995953a56fcea13a2b4cefb8de8.mp4?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous, ever-changing alien worlds filled with secrets, traps, and absurd surprises. Each planet you land on brings new biomes, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/cc1130d8452c76c3135d1b77a6e56117.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/cc1130d8452c76c3135d1b77a6e56117.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/cc1130d8452c76c3135d1b77a6e56117.mp4?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the swarm hits, customize your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place turrets, reinforce your perimeter, and experiment with different defense combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s your strategy, customize it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/161d315f743bd86ae40878972c1d790b.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/161d315f743bd86ae40878972c1d790b.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/161d315f743bd86ae40878972c1d790b.mp4?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they come, they come hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, shoot, and slam your way through relentless waves of alien freaks. Use your skills to stay alive, collect juicy loot, and protect what’s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, reactive, and just the right amount of ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.mp4?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle earns you upgrades, use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful gear, enhance your weapons, and evolve your tech tree to suit your playstyle. As the enemies grow stronger, so must you… or become space dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> is loud, chaotic, heartfelt, and just a little unhinged, exactly how saving a chicken in space should feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Makes <strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> Awesome:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠<strong>2.5D Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Chaotic alien swarms &amp; intense boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Base customizing with tactical turret placement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Fast-paced combat and dynamic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Strategic depth mixed with arcade action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Yes. The chicken is real. And important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now, and prepare for the rescue mission of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        </p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=778 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/e1329652550183800edc4843ef3971bb.webm?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Space Bross</strong></i> is a thrilling blend of action <i><strong>2.5D roguelite,</strong> and <strong>Tower Defense</strong> </i>genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/ff360e8125046ffcc3b2a237eb94f67b.poster.avif?t=1780385153\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati