codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962280/extras/08eb892cf709b8b1ba1c5bb50947a8c3.mp4?t=1780385153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle earns you upgrades, use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful gear, enhance your weapons, and evolve your tech tree to suit your playstyle. As the enemies grow stronger, so must you… or become space dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> is loud, chaotic, heartfelt, and just a little unhinged, exactly how saving a chicken in space should feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Makes <strong><i>Space Bross</i></strong> Awesome:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠<strong>2.5D Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Chaotic alien swarms &amp; intense boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Base customizing with tactical turret placement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Fast-paced combat and dynamic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Strategic depth mixed with arcade action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•⁠  ⁠Yes. The chicken is real. And important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now, and prepare for the rescue mission of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        </p>","short_description":"Your chicken has been kidnapped, and that’s all it takes to send a retired astronaut into full galactic mayhem. Space Bross is a hand-drawn 2.5D tower defense &amp; action roguelite where you’ll build bases, fend off alien hordes, and blast your way across planets to bring your feathery friend back.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati